{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19209","headline":"酬思黯见示小饮四韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬思黯见示小饮四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抛却人间第一官，俗情惊怪我方安。\n兵府相印无心恋，洛水嵩云恣意看。\n三足鼎中知味久，百寻竿上掷身难。\n追呼故旧连宵饮，直到天明兴未阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}